    <briefdescription>
<para>This structure contains info for the ML-DSA and ML-KEM key pair generation parameters. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Those two APIs are the only ones that can derive a key pair from a caller supplied seed, so the seed travels in this structure rather than in <ref refid="struct_x_asu___key_manager_params" kindref="compound">XAsu_KeyManagerParams</ref>, which every other key manager API shares and whose command length would otherwise change for all of them. </para>    </detaileddescription>
